 "align": "A Fit or Shape picture sits where the block's section CSS puts it: .sqs-block-alignment-wrapper is a full-height flex row, justify-content center, align-items from that CSS. Home's arched-window block has flex-end at desktop, so its box starts at 67.3 in a block 700.3 high; the other Shape blocks here have center."
